            <div xml:id="m-13a7eca4-0bda-4e01-8dd5-60cad87fbed4">
              <lg xml:id="m-e6239fef-ffa0-41f7-8172-88ab714e7399">
                <l xml:id="m-c369444f-b8ae-4970-a286-2703d6a799cd" facs="#m-7184e60b-30f5-4fe3-b2c9-a0da3681f976" label="ambiguous">744</l><l xml:id="m-963ebe20-bf19-4329-aef9-281a8c9a5c6d" facs="#m-c08a2ecb-6af3-4074-828e-a6efeb6439b0" label="ambiguous">Good Friday</l><l xml:id="m-476febc0-4e06-4451-a0a6-525c8c0a2aa2" facs="#m-b8493421-d7ce-4842-9cad-caaebfae0578" label="lyrics-like">Mémbra pánnis invo-lú-ta</l><l xml:id="m-400a88e0-b216-480f-adc6-577146bfbac0" facs="#m-f7a0933e-6778-49da-b2e6-e7b6ab73733d" label="lyrics-like">Virgo Má-ter álli-gat: Et</l><l xml:id="m-0518284f-1b53-42ec-92ad-044c0b3c3c84" facs="#m-8110c094-ffbd-471f-8625-2010b8c63a9b" label="lyrics-like">Dé- i mánus pe-désque Strícta cíngit fásci¬a Crux.</l><l xml:id="m-3b574993-6c29-40dd-8d33-7c36841d9b89" facs="#m-13da103c-a8d3-451a-8107-9a69ceee7e31" label="lyrics-like">V.6. Lústra sex qui jam per-é-git, Témpus ímplens córpo¬</l><l xml:id="m-ceba93f5-078d-4bd1-a469-08a5c4f68d1b" facs="#m-e669f6af-f303-48cf-a9f4-c4ab90245bbb" label="lyrics-like">ris, Sponte líbe-ra Red-émptor Passi-o-ni dédi-tus,</l><l xml:id="m-cbded4c7-a2b8-436e-b6de-f501a9692c8f" facs="#m-c1cef510-5bea-4ab5-82ea-8850f896c56c" label="lyrics-like">Agnus in Crú-cis le-vá-tur Immo-lándus stípi-te." Dúlce:</l><l xml:id="m-14a3f0e6-4579-4818-a054-5bda91066aee" facs="#m-5e8b95a5-3e8e-4717-a409-0afc880b4e99" label="lyrics-like">V. 7. Félle pó-tus ecce lánguet: Spína, clávi, lánce-a, Mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-01c8a5d5-4220-4c84-80f6-04b9967ff204" facs="#m-54d018f4-17a0-4404-a64b-29b39a9c865f" label="lyrics-like">te córpus perfo-rárunt, Unda má-nat et crú-or: Térra,</l><l xml:id="m-ac66fac8-d57d-4f40-a85d-fce7e3a043b0" facs="#m-37562ec2-8163-431a-ae82-d3f65af62e18" label="lyrics-like">póntus, ástra, múndus, Quo lavántur flúmi-ne! Crux fidélis.</l><l xml:id="m-003f5fb0-8b53-4bdf-bc15-d35253b36608" facs="#m-dbec420e-abe6-4fc0-80b8-b37dc5c5face" label="lyrics-like">V. 8. Flécte rámos, árbor álta, Ténsa láxa vísce-ra, Et rí¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d535adb-6f01-4e29-8650-5a3c317c5cde" facs="#m-cb442c67-9582-40b4-8657-1c72b082a638" label="lyrics-like">Ille, Quem dédit na-tí-vi-tas: Et su-pérni</l><l xml:id="m-76ee300b-6536-406b-8ddb-43200e023760" facs="#m-9cf0bf05-8305-4ddf-ab89-e7212a6dc1b0" label="lyrics-like">gor lentéscat</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
